{
  "analysis": "I'm starting fresh in the /workspace directory. I can see there are several files including input_notes.pdf (the main notes to analyze), instructions.txt, and a skill_context directory. I need to explore these files to understand the task requirements and the content I need to analyze for creating a revenue model.",
