  "analysis": "The SKILL.md file output is being truncated. I need to read it in parts to see the full content, and I also need to extract text from the input_notes.pdf file to understand the business context for the revenue model.",
  "plan": "1. Use head/tail or line-based reading to see the full SKILL.md content. 2. Try to extract text from the PDF using pdftotext or strings command. 3. Once I have all the context, I can design the revenue model.",
  "commands": [
    {
